          "filename": "Laguna Blanca, Bolivia (2098873574).jpg",
          "caption": "The Laguna Blanca (White Lake) is in the Altiplano de Bolivia, within the Reserva Nacional de Fauna Andina Eduardo Abaroa, Bolivia. \n\n• It is 5.6Km long and 3.5Km wide. It looks white due to minerals, mainly borax. The wind will sometimes kick up the borax dust making it look like water vapor.\nProcessing: dodge the white areas and burn the blues on the water.",
